-- the entry's parameters the compiled program reads (0 the first): the least fixed point of needed
-- parameters (x-rel-fix) with nothing assumed of the entry's own, so one passed only where no result
-- depends on it (a byte string's length handed on to a kept function, say) is not read, and the boundary
-- does not convert it
jit-reads : Word → Defs → Lst Word
jit-reads g defs = rel-of g (x-rel-fix lnil (x-arities defs) defs)
